{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289080-\u200bcraft-geomancy-and-your-game","id":1289080,"title":"\u200bCraft Geomancy and your game?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-17T21:00:29-08:00","id":1289080,"title":"\u200bCraft Geomancy and your game?","content":"We have a player that is investing in Geomancy. However there aren\u2019t really any rules for cool things to do with manses other than motes, hearth stones, and an interval bonus to workings. While customizing what hearth stone you get is fine and dandy in pervious editions of the game I believe there was all sort of fun stuff you could do! Given we do not have information on the cool things you can do with manses this edition yet what have you all been doing with it if you have had a geomancer in your games.<br /> <br /> Additionally, I was wondering if you have expanded outward from just manses into other forms of construction? Can you use geomancy to build magic buildings/infrastructure outside of manses? Perhaps like houses bigger on the inside or with magic doors that go to strange distant lands like in Howl\u2019s Moving Castle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2302-snakesandsuns","name":"Snakesandsuns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2302_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T23:08:59-08:00","id":1289109,"title":"","content":"The main problem I have with using Craft: Geomancy to build wondrous buildings that arbitrarily aren't manses is, where's the Essence that fuels their magic coming from, if not the Dragon Lines? If it's coming from the Dragon Lines, then it's a manse, even if it's a walking palace.<br /> <br /> And if it <i>is</i> coming from some other source, like a bound elemental, might not that be better represented with a sorcerous working or artifact?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 02-18-2019, 03:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T23:09:30-08:00","id":1289110,"title":"","content":"We haven't had any geomancers yet (probably because we haven't seen some 3e expansion on Manses) but I'd totally let it work for magical architecture for special buildings in my personal games","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T23:30:09-08:00","id":1289117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Snakesandsuns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289080-\u200bcraft-geomancy-and-your-game#post1289080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We have a player that is investing in Geomancy. However there aren\u2019t really any rules for cool things to do with manses other than motes, hearth stones, and an interval bonus to workings. While customizing what hearth stone you get is fine and dandy in pervious editions of the game I believe there was all sort of fun stuff you could do! Given we do not have information on the cool things you can do with manses this edition yet what have you all been doing with it if you have had a geomancer in your games.<br /> <br /> Additionally, I was wondering if you have expanded outward from just manses into other forms of construction? Can you use geomancy to build magic buildings/infrastructure outside of manses? Perhaps like houses bigger on the inside or with magic doors that go to strange distant lands like in Howl\u2019s Moving Castle?</div> </div> </div> </div>All of those sound like Manses to me though. Or Sorcerous Workings, I guess, but those might be tied to/part of Manses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T09:45:06-08:00","id":1289211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289080-\u200bcraft-geomancy-and-your-game?p=1289109#post1289109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The main problem I have with using Craft: Geomancy to build wondrous buildings that arbitrarily aren't manses is, where's the Essence that fuels their magic coming from, if not the Dragon Lines? If it's coming from the Dragon Lines, then it's a manse, even if it's a walking palace.<br /> <br /> And if it <i>is</i> coming from some other source, like a bound elemental, might not that be better represented with a sorcerous working or artifact?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was going to be a bit of a ass and ask what the difference between a magic house and a artifact actually is? However Vance clarified that craft Geomancy is only for manses as written. Which is a shame but there you go. <br /> <br /> Has anybody came up with some good manse rules then? I just want my buddy to get the most out of his ability dots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2302-snakesandsuns","name":"Snakesandsuns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2302_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T11:32:57-08:00","id":1289244,"title":"","content":"Oadinol\u2019s Codex from 2e had some pretty decent manse building rules, I think, but you would need to adjust the building point totals and the various powers to work under 3e rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T11:54:28-08:00","id":1289252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Snakesandsuns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289080-\u200bcraft-geomancy-and-your-game?p=1289211#post1289211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was going to be a bit of a ass\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>An understandable impulse, but the conversation is generally better if we can try and avoid it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Snakesandsuns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289080-\u200bcraft-geomancy-and-your-game?p=1289211#post1289211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026what the difference between a magic house and a artifact actually is?</div> </div> </div> </div>A manse is more than simply a magic house; it's specifically a structure that draws on invisible currents of aspected Essence that flows through Creation. An artifact is generally more portable, and draws the Essence it needs for its miracles from the bond it establishes with a user, sometimes supplemented further with a hearthstone in the case of stuff like warstriders.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Snakesandsuns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289080-\u200bcraft-geomancy-and-your-game?p=1289211#post1289211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">However Vance clarified that craft Geomancy is only for manses as written. Which is a shame but there you go.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why is this a problem?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Snakesandsuns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289080-\u200bcraft-geomancy-and-your-game?p=1289211#post1289211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just want my buddy to get the most out of his ability dots.</div> </div> </div> </div>One of my players wanted to build a geomancer character in a Dreaming Sea game, and while the game never materialized, my plan was to use the same sort of table negotiations used in the system for crafting artifacts and creating sorcerous workings. Entering into the factors for what sort of manse he would build would include a mix of the materials he has available to build with, the Aspect and strength of the demesne on which he's building, what powers seem reasonable, and just how cool he can describe it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T13:06:08-08:00","id":1289277,"title":"","content":"One thing to remember, from a fluff perspective, is that building a Manse is expensive. It takes time, materials, laborers, tools... and if you can get someone else to foot the bill for all this, then you can also probably charge that person an arm-and-a-leg for doing so for them. Shouldn't take more than a few Manses as commissions before you can start making them for yourself. Don't know if that helps, but it's something to keep in mind!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>DrLoveMonkey - &quot;On the other hand having a warhammer that's basically a steel beer keg on the end of a seven foot pole is fucking awesome.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9453-octopoid","name":"Octopoid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"424"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T13:18:00-08:00","id":1289287,"title":"","content":"Not in my game, but I've got a bullet-point-list of ideas to develop in my notes for &quot;mortal-level Geomancy&quot;. <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Various forms of wards (inspired by 2e Thaumaturgical wards) -- Basic to Major.</li> <li>Elemental-growing concentrator (landscape naturally concentrates essence, births elementals of a type chosen) -- Major/Superior depending on power.</li> <li>Auspicious site -- geographical equivalent of superior tools (not cumulative with) -- Major to Superior based on how broad.</li> <li>Wyld concentration/drain -- cause area to move up/down one level of Wyldness over time -- Major to Superior depending on speed, scope.</li> <li>Shadowland enlarge/reduce.</li> <li>Rattle the Sanctum's Gate -- cut off essence to a god's sanctum, 2e thaumaturgy -- Major.</li> <li>Microclimate mods -- make a small area able to support a lemon tree in the North, cactus in the jungle, thirsty shade-loving plants in the desert -- Basic+ depending on degree of change, area.</li> </ol><br /> The assumption is that dragon lines still can have influence outside of a demense, so geomancy that isn't making manses can still have magical effects, just weaker ones (and that the weaker ones can be safely handled by mortals working from recipes and trial-and-error, while manse-level work requires the ability to perceive essence).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/572-verzio","name":"Verzio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar572_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}